iately via load_skill, or by typing $name in the chat input.\n\nBefore creating one, load the \"skill-creator\" skill for authoring guidelines.","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["name","description","content"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string","description":"Skill name: lowercase letters, digits, and hyphens only (e.g. \"release-checklist\")."},"description":{"type":"string","description":"When to use the skill. The model picks skills by this text alone, so state the trigger conditions, not the mechanics."},"content":{"type":"string","description":"Markdown instructions to follow when the skill is loaded. Use $ARGUMENTS where runtime input should be substituted."},"global":{"type":"boolean","description":"true (default) saves to ~/.agnes/skills for all projects; false saves to <working-dir>/.agnes/skills for this project only."},"argument_hint":{"type":"string","description":"Optional usage hint shown next to the skill in the $ picker, e.g. \"[file] [--strict]\"."}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"edit","description":"Edit a file by finding and replacing text. The before text must match exactly and uniquely. Use empty after text to delete. In Full access (auto) mode, destinations outside the current workspace are denied without a confirmation prompt, regardless of user_specified_output. In approval modes, for an external destination explicitly requested by the user, set user_specified_output=true and wait for this call's confirmation; otherwise the edit is denied.","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","title":"FileEditParams","type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"before":{"type":"string"},"after":{"type":"string"},"user_specified_output":{"description":"Set true only when the user explicitly requested this workspace-external destination.","type":"boolean","default":false}},"required":["path","before","after"]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"encyclopedia_search","description":"Search