ool name in format \"server/tool\" (e.g., \"developer/shell\")","type":"string"},"description":{"description":"Brief description of what this call does (e.g., \"list files in /src\")","type":"string"},"depends_on":{"description":"Indices of nodes this depends on (empty if no dependencies)","type":"array","items":{"type":"integer","format":"uint","minimum":0},"default":[]}},"required":["tool","description"]}},"required":[]}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"get_function_details","description":"Get detailed TypeScript definitions for specific functions.\n\nProvide function names in 'namespace.functionName' format (e.g., 'Notion.apiPostSearch').\nReturns full type signatures, parameter schemas, and return types.\n\nNote: Functions showing Promise<any> return type have no schema - the actual runtime\nvalue is a parsed JavaScript object (never a JSON string).","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","title":"GetFunctionDetailsInput","type":"object","properties":{"functions":{"description":"List of functions to get details of.","type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/FunctionId"}}},"required":["functions"],"$defs":{"FunctionId":{"description":"Function representation in the form should be in the form '<namespace>.<function name>'. e.g. If there is a function `getData` within the `DataApi` namespace the value provided in this field is DataApi.getData","type":"string"}}}}},{"type":"function","function":{"name":"image_search","description":"Search for and locally verify web images. Prefer explicitly requested or configured image tools. Batch multiple subjects. Do not publish candidates as user-facing artifacts unless the user asked to see or save the images. For reports, slides, HTML, or other documents set source_material=true.","parameters":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","title":"ImageSearchParams","type":"object","properties":{"query":{"description":"Concise image query. Optional when `queries` is provided."